<td id="S5.T4.2.4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">(PC-6082 is fast.)</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T4.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T4.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" colspan="2">jsem-576, Gold answer: no</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T4.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T4.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">P1</td>
<td id="S5.T4.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<table id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<tr id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:176.4pt;">
<span id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">PC-6082-wa ITEL-XZ to onaji kurai-no hayasa-da.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:176.4pt;">
<span id="S5.T4.2.6.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">(PC-6082 is as fast as ITEL-XZ.)</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T4.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T4.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">P2</td>
<td id="S5.T4.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<table id="S5.T4.2.7.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;">
<tr id="S5.T4.2.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
