<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Combinatory Rules of CCG</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show some combinatory rules of CCG below (see <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Steedman (2000)</a></cite> for details).</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Forward functional application rule
<br class="ltx_break">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-12.4pt;">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_bottom">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{X/Y}:{f}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{X/Y}:{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text">   </span><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{Y}:{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{Y}:{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:0.5pt;"></span><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:81.6pt;"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:81.6pt;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-2.0pt;"> <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_p">    <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"> <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{X}:{f\,a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{X}:{f\,a}</annotation></semantics></math></span> </span></span>
</span></span></span>
